flowchart LR
  IMU[Six IMU channels] --> R[128-step resampling] --> S[Sensor CNN]
  RGB[Completed RGB clip] --> H[Optical-flow histogram] --> V[HOF-GRU or tiny HOF-Transformer]
  S --> F[Arithmetic or normalized product; unchanged surviving branch]
  V --> F
  F --> O[Ordered class probabilities and top-1 prediction]
  O --> C[Acceptance not evaluated]
  N[Neither input] --> M[Insufficient input]
